sequenceDiagram
    actor Teacher as Giảng viên
    participant UI as Trạm camera
    participant API as Recognition API
    participant Permission as PermissionService
    participant Service as RecognitionService
    participant AI as CompreFaceClient
    participant DB as Database

    Teacher->>UI: Bật camera và bắt đầu quét
    UI->>API: POST /api/recognition/image
    API->>Permission: ensure_session(user, session_id)
    Permission-->>API: Hợp lệ
    API->>Service: recognize_image(frame)
    Service->>AI: recognize(frame)
    AI-->>Service: subject, similarity, box
    Service->>DB: Tạo RecognitionEvent
    Service->>DB: Tìm FaceProfile và Student
    Service->>DB: Kiểm tra thuộc lớp session
    Service-->>UI: MATCHED_IN_CLASS hoặc trạng thái cảnh báo
